<title>CHINA: Trading in Righteous shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Righteous shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in Righteous (Holdings) Ltd shares was suspended on Friday at the request of the company pending an announcement, the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong said.</p>
<p>The stock rose HK$0.085 on Friday to close at HK$0.49 at midsession.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
</text>
